	)
	(text "Notes\nVBAT = pack after fuse and switch, 10.5-12.6 V.\nAll grounds are common: run EXT_PWR GND and buck IN- straight\nto the pack negative in heavy wire.\nServo 1 header power is the shield's 5 V logic rail, not EXT_PWR.\n5 A fuse because two stalled motors can exceed 3 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3689ce26-ae4c-4b06-8963-034c27814371")
	)
	(text "+5V goes to the Pi USB-C through a USB-A to C cable\nwith the A end cut off: red = +5 V, black = GND.\nMeter it before plugging in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "48870472-0568-45a0-b801-fe9278d2b09e")
	)
	(text "5V-LINK jumper ON: powered from the Pi.\nRESET is capacitor-coupled to GPIO18 on the aLaMode.\nPi-aLaMode and aLaMode-shield links are stacked headers, not wires."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.85 148.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aa6e4fa7-0488-456e-8485-986af55f4a2e")
	)
	(text "VBAT: pack after fuse and switch, 10.5-12.6 V.\n5 A fuse: two stalled motors can exceed 3 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d5494285-a860-4a25-998a-4a03baedfb90")
	)
	(text "HC-SR04 VCC comes from the A3-A5 header 5 V row\n(the A0-A2 row is 3.3 V)."
